        <mxCell id="43" value="3.1 stops the application when the program is closed, the slot limit is full, or the beneficiary type does not match.&lt;br&gt;An email that already belongs to an applicant updates that profile. A staff email is rejected.&lt;br&gt;The new public user is inactive. The password emailed later is created only when staff accept the draft or give final approval.&lt;br&gt;Files are PDF, JPG or PNG, up to 5 MB, saved under documents/{application}." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
